commits.message:
test(tui-gateway): fold the branch-row login assertion into the desktop identity test

Two invariant tests: a logged-in Desktop session (and its branch child) names the human on the row;
an anonymous transport keeps user_id empty. Salvage of #114398 (@Finn763) — trimmed to the two-test bar.

test(agent): pass issuer_model through the Perplexity alias normalize stub

main widened _normalize_codex_response with issuer_model after #103775 branched;
the cherry-picked stub lambda rejected the new kwarg.

test(gateway): non-photo media follow-ups stay separate FIFO items in queue mode

Invariant: three voice notes (plus a video and a document) are five FIFO items;
control: a photo burst with a trailing caption still merges into one album event.
